OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fspells of rain this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight. The rain gradually shifts
OL,8,Fwestward, resulting in drier
OL,9,Fconditions along the coast by Tuesday
OL,10,Fmorning. A light southeasterly breeze
OL,11,Ffor most, with breezier conditions
OL,12,Falong the coast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FA cloudy and damp morning for
OL,15,Fmany, followed by a drier interlude
OL,16,Fduring the afternoon before further
OL,17,Frain returns by the evening. Remaining
OL,18,Fbreezy along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
