OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FPatchy
OL,6,Fcloud, with light winds Wednesday
OL,7,Fmorning, followed by outbreaks of
OL,8,Fheavy rain. Dry with sunny spells and
OL,9,Flight winds Thursday. Heavy and
OL,10,Fpersistent rain, accompanied by strong
OL,11,Fwinds Friday.
